      "teaser": "Feel like Tarkov boss",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/1756.png",
      "downloads": 2957,
      "favourites_count": 0,
      "description": "<p>Do you want to add variety to the gameplay as a scav? Then this mod is for you!</p>\n<p>With a certain chance you have the opportunity to play as a scav boss.</p>\n<p>Contains a configuration with which you can configure it.</p>\n<p>{ //removing the scav cooldown “remove_scav_cooldown”: true, //If enabled, it replaces the colored keycards with an access keycards to the laboratory “replace_color_keycards”: true, //Chance to become the boss at each fence reputation level “chances_to_become_boss”: [ 1, 5, 10, 15, 20, 25, 35 ], //list of bosses you can play as “boss_list”: [ “bossboar”, “bossbully”, “bossgluhar”, “bosskilla”, “bossknight”, “bosskojaniy”, “bosskolontay”, “bosspartisan”, “bosssanitar”, “bosstagilla”, “bosszryachiy”, “followerbigpipe”, “followerbirdeye” ] } There are a few things I want to make clear:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Scavs can still shoot you if you have a bad reputation.</li>\n<li>You will spawn at the PMC spawnpoints.</li>\n<li>Bosses with the same type as yours may still be on the location.</li>\n<li>Followers and scav’s do not listen to you, considering you an ordinary scav.</li>\n<li>Tagilla’s hammer was removed due to being unplayable</li>\n</ul>\n<p>All this will be fixed in future versions.</p>\n",
